- question.
- options.
- correct_answer.
- explanation.
- distractor_explanations.
- concept_id.
- subject.
- grade.
- chapter.
- lesson.
- cognitive_level.
- difficulty.
- source_reference.
- source_page.
- source_type.
- model_id.
- prompt_version.
